{%- comment -%}
  Outputs page or article rich text with Shopify Buy Button embeds taken out.

  Older posts carry Buy Button code pasted into the body: a script that loads
  an iframe of products with its own buttons, type and cart, none of it the
  theme's, and a cart separate from the store's. The script is dropped here
  and the products it pointed at are shown as the theme's own product cards
  under the post (snippets/editorial-products.liquid). Its empty mount node
  stays and collapses to nothing. Any other script is left alone.

  Accepts:
  - content: {String} Rich text HTML (required)
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  if content contains 'ShopifyBuy'
    assign parts = content | split: '<script'
    echo parts.first
    for part in parts offset: 1
      if part contains 'ShopifyBuy'
        # Liquid's split drops a trailing empty piece, so a script that ends
        # the content leaves one piece — its own body — which must not print.
        assign pieces = part | split: '</script>'
        if pieces.size > 1
          echo pieces.last
        endif
      else
        echo '<script' | append: part
      endif
    endfor
  else
    echo content
  endif
-%}
